      "writtenOn": "2020-05-30T20:20:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The exit from PW_WAIT_FOR_ERROR_RECOVERY does not have a known connection.  Not until we land in one of the ATTACHED states will we know that.  The main way in to an attached state would be the auto-toggle locates a connection and we know at that point that it exists. This is why AutoDischargeDisconnect is enabled immediately in that case.  In the case of error recovery, this is not true.",
      "parentUuid": "b886e046_953ef75d",
